Thought: First, I need to generate a dataset of oxide polymorphs. I'll start by retrieving polymorph data for some oxide compositions.
Action: batch_retrieve_polymorphs
Action Input: {"compositions": ["Al2O3", "TiO2", "Fe2O3", "ZnO", "MgO", "CuO", "NiO", "Cr2O3", "MnO2", "V2O5"], "max_energy_above_hull": 0.3, "max_per_composition": 3, "save_directory": "oxide_polymorphs"}

Thought: Now that I have the polymorph data for multiple oxide compositions, I need to consolidate them into a single dataset before preparing it for machine learning.
Action: consolidate_polymorph_datasets
Action Input: {"composition_files": {"Al2O3": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/Al2O3_polymorphs.json", "TiO2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/TiO2_polymorphs.json", "Fe2O3": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/Fe2O3_polymorphs.json", "ZnO": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/ZnO_polymorphs.json", "MgO": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/MgO_polymorphs.json", "CuO": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/CuO_polymorphs.json", "NiO": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/NiO_polymorphs.json", "Cr2O3": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/Cr2O3_polymorphs.json", "MnO2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/MnO2_polymorphs.json", "V2O5": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/oxide_polymorphs/V2O5_polymorphs.json"}, "output_path": "consolidated_oxides.json"}

Thought: Now I need to prepare the tabular dataset for machine learning with advanced feature engineering, normalization, and test split as specified in the input parameters.
Action: prepare_tabular_dataset
Action Input: {"polymorphs_json_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/consolidated_oxides.json", "output_path": "ml_dataset", "target_property": "formation_energy_per_atom", "feature_engineering": "advanced", "test_split": 0.2, "normalize": true}

Thought: Now I'll train the XGBoost model using the prepared dataset with the specified hyperparameters.
Action: train_xgboost_model
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/ml_dataset/train.csv", "test_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/ml_dataset/test.csv", "model_save_path": "xgboost_model.json", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}

Thought: Let's perform cross-validation to get additional performance metrics since the detailed evaluation encountered an error.
Action: perform_cross_validation
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_4/ml_dataset/train.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "cv_folds": 5, "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}
